# Authentication Anti-Patterns

## Storing passwords in plain text

```java
// WRONG — plain text password
user.setPassword(password);
```

**Hash with BCrypt: `BCrypt.hashpw(password, BCrypt.gensalt(12))`. Never store plain text.**

## No session expiry — token valid forever

```java
// WRONG — token never expires
String token = UUID.randomUUID().toString();
```

**Set expiry: `Instant.now().plus(Duration.ofHours(8))`. Re-authenticate after expiry.**

## Hardcoded roles — can't add new roles

```java
// WRONG — if-else role checks
if (user.getRole().equals("ADMIN")) { ... }
```

**Use enum + RBAC: `Role.ADMIN.hasPermission(Permission.DELETE_PRODUCT)`**